l the things we learned\nfor the people who are still alive.\n\nGo ahead and leave me.\nI think I'd prefer to stay inside.\nMaybe you'll find someone else\nto help you.\nMaybe Black Mesa?\nTHAT WAS A JOKE. HA-HA, FAT CHANCE.\nAnyway, this cake is great.           THE CAKE IS A LIE. THE CAKE IS A LIE. THE CAKE IS A LIE. THE CAKE IS A LIE. THE CAKE IS A LIE.\nIt's so delicious and moist.\nLook at me, still talking when there's science to do.\nWhen I look out there, it makes me GLaD I'm not you.\nI've experiments to run, there is research to be done.\nOn the people who are still alive.\n\nAnd believe me, I am still alive.\nI'm doing science and I'm still alive.\nI feel fantastic and I'm still alive.\nWhile you're dying, I'll be still alive.\nAnd when you're dead, I will be still alive.\nStill alive.\nStill alive.\n]]","owner":{"_id":"64d55232014a43d861d94256","username":"randomsuki","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/64d55232014a43d861d94256-1710734504427.png","status":"offline","id":"64d55232014a43d861d94256","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":198486,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2023-08-10T21:22:09.767Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":15,"image":"/images/sb/7953746-1691811486108.webp","executes":10370,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":10035,"at":"2026-10-06T00:30:04.913Z"}],"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4bb1a","editBy":{"_id":"64d55232014a43d861d94256","username":"randomsuki","status":"offline","id":"64d55232014a43d861d94256"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2023-08-10T21:35:50.213Z"},{"_id":"67e5e1e2b360710ec3c4bb1b","editBy":{"_id":"64d55232014a43d861d94256","username":"randomsuki","status":"offline","id":"64d55232014a43d861d94256"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2023-08-11T04:01:05.204Z"},{"_id":"67e